Author: Marcus Schack Abildskov <work@marcus-sa.dev>
Date:   Sat Nov 21 12:58:19 2026 +0100

    feat(node-local-persistent-volume): SimVolumeBacking honours the VolumeBacking port contract
    
    The sim adapter now enforces the ensure preconditions, derives the
    canonical volume name, and reports claim_state (NotFound, Held, Free)
    with a claim released when its VMM dies. The port docstrings pin the
    ensure bound, owner and deadline properties and the claim_state
    contract. The sim keeps no timer: the adapter owns the 30 s deadline.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Step-Id: 03-01
    Task-Id: node-local-persistent-volume

